@baseUrl = http://localhost:5117

### Customer directory (Windows Negotiate authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers

### Calculated order summaries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### Order detail (set an existing order ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### Client analysis (all clients)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis

### Client analysis (filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis?customerId=1
